{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_1000_situation", "source_sha256": "d32d200edc0bc151411af6b06c4adda6a752340442b88c85a670399a491921fd", "ja": "情報番組のお仕事", "zh": "资讯节目工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_1000_place", "source_sha256": "d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c", "ja": "事務所", "zh": "办公室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4eff18a71ee682ce7e00734f6de95dd61b734a35f82b63545853ef7282188f22", "ja": "うう～、もうダメ……つまんない～！　ゲストなのに、\nなんでこんなに勉強しなきゃいけないんですか～？", "zh": "呜呜～不行了……好无聊～！我明明是来宾，\n为什么还要这么认真念书～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_1002_p", "source_sha256": "21b64d36a2b84b4f92ae2cc32684257b6b44507ccd4a043f05c86ce53f6f0835", "ja": "ああ、ロケの事前資料か。確かに、すごい量だけど……\nリポーターを務めるんだから、頑張らないとな。", "zh": "喔，是出外景前的资料啊。这资料量的确很多……\n但你是担任报导特派员，得努力才行啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f249d099934d470c88dd47bf3bed6505f9b1d6a15212445b7bba70e319c172b5", "ja": "それはわかってますけど……。なんかお仕事なのに、\n学校のテスト勉強してるみたい……。", "zh": "这我也知道……可是明明是在工作，\n感觉却跟准备学校的考试没两样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e098424727e86e54860109757aeb8103362ad340c7e873c30ab6848e49816165", "ja": "仕方ないな……じゃあリポートが上手くいったら、\nご褒美に、翼の好きなところに連れていってあげよう。", "zh": "真拿你没办法……那如果你能报导得好，\n作为奖励，我就带你去你喜欢的地方吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1ba782b313507b024917955d10ed4443da037d83fec5004464e1f67f2911d1f9", "ja": "え、ホントですか！？　やった～♪\nわたし、行きたいトコいっぱいあるんですよ～！", "zh": "咦，真的吗！？好耶～♪\n我有很多想去的地方喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "182cdd464df2984347fe3d98d05114ecf7f544bc576f0127291efc2feb933828", "ja": "どこにしようかな～えへへっ。\nわたし、頑張っちゃいま～す♪", "zh": "要选哪里好呢～嘿嘿～\n我会加油的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4a3670f9c6e536fbe3b3a61914cdd3960fc7f79f7612ee6280a40bb777249ef5", "ja": "（熱心に資料を読み始めた……。\nそのやる気が、いつも出ていればなぁ……）", "zh": "（她开始专心读资料了……\n要是她能随时都这么有干劲就好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
